# Analysis run output. Clustering Alleles / Determining Alleles write their
# results to whatever "Output folder" the user picks in the GUI -- that
# folder normally lives outside this repo, but these patterns guard against
# accidentally committing a run that was pointed inside it.
_results/
rawdata/
